The '''serpent's bed of sand''' is an earth spell created by the four apprentices of [[Qifrey's Atelier]] that creates a cloud  made of sand.

== Description ==
The serpent's bed of sand is an amalgamation of several spells. At it's center is a [[Billowing Collection|billowing collection]] spell, which contains a central billowing keystone surrounded by collection keystones. Arranged around that are several [[Wall Breaker Seal|wall breaker seals]], the seals containing an earth sigil paired with crush and column signs, all wrapped up in a [[Repetition Seal|repetition seal]] which contains repetition sigils, convergence signs, and column signs. It creates a large, fluffy cloud out of sand, and is strong enough to hold up a [[Dragon|dragon]].{{Ref|m|7}}

== Usage ==
The spell was created by the four apprentices of Qifrey's Atelier, [[Tetia]], [[Richeh]], [[Coco]], and [[Agott]]. It was then used to make the dragon guarding the [[Illusory Labyrinth|illusory labyrinth]] glyph fall asleep, allowing the girls to destroy it and escape.{{Ref|m|7}}

